<title>HONG KONG: Pacific Concord interim net down 54 pct.</title>
<headline>Pacific Concord interim net down 54 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.22 vs 6.97</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.83 vs 1.83</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    60.37 vs 130.56</p>
<p>    Turnover		     345.77 vs 621.41</p>
<p>    Company name		 Pacific Concord Holding Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 22 to 25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 25</p>
<p>NOTE - Pacific Concord manufactures and sells watches, watch components and cosmetics. It is also engaged in hotel management, beauty salons and travel agencies.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
